          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "પડોશી (paḍośī) is a tadbhava. It comes from Sanskrit prativēśya, \"neighbour\"; CDIAL lists Gujarati paṛośī (CDIAL 8599)."
            }
          ]
        },
